    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n4 Bedroom detached two storey house in a mature sought after development, with an enviable location on the south side of Drogheda just off the Dublin Road. The property enjoys well-proportioned accommodation (Approx. 125m²/1,345ft²) coupled with a south-west facing rear garden and generous space to side of house suitable for car parking or side extension subject to planning permission. This superb location is only minutes' walk away from several services including Drogheda train station and a host of local amenities such as schools, shops, restaurants, pubs and frequent public transport links to Dublin city centre. Junction 7 of the M1 Motorway is 9.8km away and it's only a 25 minute drive to Dublin Airport and the M50 orbital Motorway. Viewing is highly recommended by appointment only with sole agents Sherry FitzGerald Lannon."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 4.69 x 1.77\n\n\nSitting Room - 5.05 x 4.27\n\n\nDining Room - 4.25 x 2.92\n\n\nKitchen/Dining - 5.57 x 3.12\n\n\nUtility - 1.46 x 1.60\n\n\nWC - 0.75 x 1.46\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.51 x 3.98\n\n\nEnsuite - 1.18 x 2.91\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.92 x 3.52\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.12 x 2.49\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.59 x 2.62\n\n\nBathroom - 2.15 x 1.72\n\n\nTOTAL: - Approx. 125 SqM/ 1,345 SqFt\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Gas central heating</li><li>PVC double glazed windows</li><li>Tiled and wood flooring throughout ground floor</li><li>Wood flooring to all bedrooms</li><li>Large secure south-west facing rear garden</li><li>Generous side access</li><li>Space to extend to side</li><li>Beautiful mature sought after development on south side of Drogheda</li><li>15 minute walk to Drogheda train station</li><li>5 minute walk to Black Bull Pub & Restaurant</li><li>10 minute walk to Cross-Route local amenities centre</li><li>2.3km from Drogheda town centre</li><li>25 minute drive to Dublin Airport and M50 orbital motorway</ul>"
      },
